@page "/pricing"

<PageTitle>Pricing — FitSpiralS</PageTitle>

<div class="fs-pricing-page">
    @* ===== HERO ===== *@
    <div class="fs-pricing-hero fs-animate">
        <h1>Three tiers. Launching April 2026.</h1>
        <p>Built for lifters, competitors, and coaches. Pricing announced at launch.</p>
    </div>

    @* ===== PRICING CARDS ===== *@
    <div class="fs-pricing" style="padding-top:0;">
        <div class="fs-pricing-grid">
            <PricingCard TierName="Athlete" Price="0" Delay="1" Tagline="For the dedicated lifter"
                Features="@(["Periodized programs", "RPE autoregulation", "Fatigue modeling", "Basic analytics", "Weight & body comp"])" />
            <PricingCard TierName="Competitor" Price="0" Highlighted="true" Delay="2" Tagline="For the serious competitor"
                Features="@(["Everything in Athlete", "Advanced analytics & charts", "Training partners", "Goal tracking & insights", "Data export"])" />
            <PricingCard TierName="Coach" Price="0" Delay="3" Tagline="For coaches who build champions"
                Note="Free when you maintain 20+ client subscriptions"
                Features="@(["Everything in Competitor", "Unlimited athletes", "Alert engine (6 types)", "Program gen for athletes", "Coach dashboard & notes"])" />
        </div>
    </div>

    @* ===== FAQ ===== *@
    <section class="fs-faq fs-animate">
        <h2>Questions? Answers.</h2>

        <details>
            <summary>When does FitSpiralS launch?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                April 2026. Beta testers get early access before public launch.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How do I get into the beta?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Email us at beta@fitspirals.com. Tell us what you lift and what you're tired of in training apps. We're looking for serious lifters and coaches who want to shape the product.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>What do beta testers get?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Full access to every feature before anyone else. Direct input into what we build. And the satisfaction of knowing you helped shape something worth using.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>What periodization models do you support?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Linear, undulating, and block periodization. Programs are auto-generated based on your goals, experience level, and available training days.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>How does the coach platform work?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                Coaches can invite unlimited athletes, monitor training via dashboards, set up 6 types of automated alerts, generate programs, and add contextual notes — all remotely. Free when you maintain 20+ client subscriptions.
            </div>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>Is there a commitment?</summary>
            <div class="fs-faq-answer">
                No. Your data is always exportable. No annual lock-in. No contracts.
            </div>
        </details>
    </section>

    @* ===== FINAL CTA ===== *@
    <section class="fs-cta">
        <h2 class="fs-animate">Be first. Apply for early access.</h2>
        <p class="fs-animate fs-delay-1">April 2026. Spots are limited.</p>
        <a href="mailto:beta@fitspirals.com?subject=FitSpiralS Beta Application" class="fs-btn-primary fs-pulse-glow fs-animate fs-delay-2">Apply for Early Access</a>
    </section>
</div>
